m; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1415150/extras/a9dc41976b46bb89eb2648aca7f4bc89.mp4?t=1661802561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Other gameplay features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enemy variety consisting of 8+ enemies.</li><li>Recover a certain amount of health when you kill an enemy with the last bullet in your magazine.</li><li>Use your character\u2019s abilities and create your own gameplay style.</li></ul>",
